# Machine-local room permissions, written by .claude/provision-room.sh.
# Contains this host's permission grants for a headless agent; it is per-worktree
# state, not project configuration, and must never be committed from a task room.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Convenience symlinks placed at each project root by build.py, pointing
# into the (already-ignored) build/debug/ tree. They are regenerated by any
# build and resolve to nothing on a fresh clone, so committing them would
# publish broken links. 34 of these were staged by a blanket `git add` on
